      "sourceTextSha256": "b1d4bebcfece8092750a07ff9bd556b806afa13c6a298de62bfdbaa500bc4b10",
      "text": "Day 7 · South from Paramaribo, past forest giants and villages, to the river port of Atjoni and a canoe trip up the Upper Suriname River to a lodge among the rapids. After a light buffet lunch, explore the jungle and enjoy a “natural massage” in the rapids; in the evening, look for caimans under a starry sky. All meals and non-alcoholic drinks included.",
